1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:02,030
(Amy(answering phone):)Sheldon, what's wrong?

2
00:00:02,032 --> 00:00:05,572
(Sheldon:)I wanted to let you know I'll be
spending your birthday with you.

3
00:00:06,436 --> 00:00:08,566
(Amy:)Okay.

4
00:00:08,572 --> 00:00:11,872
See, I-I had tickets to the
Star Wars premiere that night,

5
00:00:11,875 --> 00:00:14,305
(Sheldon:)but Professor Proton came to me
in a dream dressed as

6
00:00:14,311 --> 00:00:17,411
(Sheldon:)Obi-Wan Kenobi and convinced me
I should be with you.

7
00:00:18,248 --> 00:00:20,148
(Amy:)Obi-what?

8
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:23,080
I'll-I'll let you get back
to sleep now. Good night.

9
00:00:23,086 --> 00:00:24,556
(Amy:)Okay. Good night. Wait.

10
00:00:24,554 --> 00:00:25,984
(Amy:)Um, Sheldon,

11
00:00:25,989 --> 00:00:28,919
were you actually not gonna
spend my birthday with me?

12
00:00:30,761 --> 00:00:33,531
(Sheldon:)It's late. Got to go. Bye.

13
00:00:34,698 --> 00:00:35,998
(Raj:)Good for Sheldon deciding

14
00:00:35,999 --> 00:00:38,299
(Raj:)to stay with Amy on her birthday.
I know.

15
00:00:38,301 --> 00:00:40,271
(Leonard:)It's still gonna be weird
to see the movie without him.

16
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:44,240
(Howard:)Well, we could wait a
couple days and see it together.

17
00:00:45,308 --> 00:00:47,208
(loud laughter)

18
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:49,540
(Sheldon:)Hello.

19
00:00:49,546 --> 00:00:51,446
(Leonard:)Hey. We're going to the comic
book store. You want to come?

20
00:00:51,448 --> 00:00:52,878
(Sheldon:)No, I can't.

21
00:00:52,883 --> 00:00:55,013
(Sheldon:)I need to make preparations
for Amy's birthday.

22
00:00:55,018 --> 00:00:56,148
(Sheldon:)Which leads me

23
00:00:56,153 --> 00:00:58,283
(Sheldon:)to the following bit
of business.

